{"seq":3,"slug":"fiction-writing","title":"小说创作","stage":"DONE","category":"writing","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.38,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 小说创作 简介\n\n小说是人类最具感染力的叙事艺术形式之一。通过虚构的人物、情节和世界观，小说能够探索人性的深度、反映社会的复杂性，并为读者创造沉浸式的阅读体验。从古典文学到网络文学，从纯文学到类型小说，小说创作始终是文学领域中最活跃、最具创造力的分支。\n\n本知识库面向所有对小说创作感兴趣的写作者，无论你是怀揣文学梦想的初学者，还是已有一定创作经验但希望突破技法瓶颈的写作者。如果你曾经在脑海中构建过一个故事世界，却不知如何将它化为文字，这里将为你提供从构思到完稿的全流程指导。\n\n知识库将系统性地探讨以下主题：故事的核心要素，包括前提、主题和叙事结构；人物塑造的方法论，从性格设计到角色弧线；情节构建与节奏控制，掌握悬念、冲突和转折的设计技巧；场景描写与对话写作，让你的故事鲜活生动；视角与叙事声音的选择，建立独特的叙述风格；以及修改与打磨技巧，将初稿提升为成熟的作品。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"narrative-foundations","title":"叙事基础","docCount":4,"url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/narrative-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"story-core-elements","title":"故事核心要素","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/narrative-foundations/story-core-elements"},{"seq":2,"slug":"point-of-view","title":"叙事视角","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/narrative-foundations/point-of-view"},{"seq":3,"slug":"story-structure-models","title":"故事结构模型","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/narrative-foundations/story-structure-models"},{"seq":4,"slug":"pacing-and-tension","title":"节奏与张力","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/narrative-foundations/pacing-and-tension"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"character-creation","title":"人物塑造","docCount":4,"url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/character-creation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"character-arc","title":"角色弧光","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/character-creation/character-arc"},{"seq":2,"slug":"motivation-and-conflict","title":"动机与冲突","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/character-creation/motivation-and-conflict"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dialogue-craft","title":"对话技艺","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/character-creation/dialogue-craft"},{"seq":4,"slug":"supporting-characters","title":"配角设计","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/character-creation/supporting-characters"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"worldbuilding","title":"世界观构建","docCount":4,"url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/worldbuilding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"worldbuilding-methods","title":"世界构建方法","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/worldbuilding/worldbuilding-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"rules-and-logic","title":"规则与逻辑","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/worldbuilding/rules-and-logic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"culture-and-society","title":"文化与社会","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/worldbuilding/culture-and-society"},{"seq":4,"slug":"environment-and-senses","title":"环境与感官","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/worldbuilding/environment-and-senses"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"genre-writing","title":"类型写作","docCount":4,"url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/genre-writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"science-fiction","title":"科幻小说","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/genre-writing/science-fiction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mystery-and-thriller","title":"悬疑与惊悚","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/genre-writing/mystery-and-thriller"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fantasy","title":"奇幻小说","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/genre-writing/fantasy"},{"seq":4,"slug":"realism","title":"现实主义小说","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/genre-writing/realism"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"revision-and-publishing","title":"修改与出版","docCount":4,"url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/revision-and-publishing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"self-editing","title":"自我修改","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/revision-and-publishing/self-editing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"beta-readers","title":"Beta 读者","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/revision-and-publishing/beta-readers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"submission-process","title":"投稿流程","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/revision-and-publishing/submission-process"},{"seq":4,"slug":"web-serialization","title":"网络连载","url":"/h/writing/fiction-writing/revision-and-publishing/web-serialization"}]}]}